<title>USA: Farmland shuts Kansas cat cracker for 10 days.</title>
<headline>Farmland shuts Kansas cat cracker for 10 days.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Farmland Industries Inc shut a 28,000 barrels per day (bpd) catalytic cracker Tuesday at its Coffeyville, Kansas refinery for 10 days of unscheduled maintenance, a company spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>The refinery has a total crude capacity of 100,000 bpd, the spokeswoman said, and was currently operating at about 40% percent of that level.</p>
<p>-- New York Energy Desk, +1 212 858 1620</p>
</text>
